    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856210/extras/01168d995f9a9e99ee669937234f8d9a.avif?t=1719544292\" /></div><br><br>&quot;The Frozen Kingdom&quot; is a <strong>18+ BL visual nov</strong>el inspired by the <strong>sword &amp; sorcery fantasy</strong> films of the 80s such as Fire and Ice, Deathstalker, and of course, Conan. The idea behind it is simple: take the homoerotism of a genre full of hot, scantily dressed men and make it textual.<br><br>Hundreds of years ago, humans and elves came together to defeat the evil sorceress whose magic had plunged the world into an endless winter. Unbeknownst to them, said sorceress had a son, Oggun, and he\u2019s been bidding his time ever since, waiting for the opportunity to take her place to arise.<br><br>Our protagonist, Einar, becomes the last descendant of the warrior who slayed the sorceress after Oggun's men destroy his village. Now on a quest for revenge, Einar finds himself joining forces with an elven nobleman and a merchant friend of his that, by matter of fate, both happened to be at the village at the time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856210/extras/fcb9df1c86adb1edefea1bd26148b39c.avif?t=1719544292\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 50,000 words<br></li><li>Spanish &amp; English versions<br></li><li>15 CGs<br></li><li>12 original backgrounds<br></li><li>Original OST</li></ul>",
